Here is the commit message:
OOZIE-2536 Hadoop's cleanup of local directory in uber mode
 causing failures (satishsaley via rohini)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by Hadoop's cleanup process which was trying to delete or clean up local directories during execution in uber mode, leading to failures when a required configuration file (`PROPAGATION_CONF_XML`) did not exist. The absence of this file meant that the necessary settings for the job were not available, resulting in errors during the cleanup phase.

